$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2
*(mgdb-gene-record
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<meta name="twitter:site" content="@MaizeGDB">
<meta property="og:title" content="$(gene_name) &mdash; MaizeGDB gene record">
<meta property="og:description" content="$(gene_summary)">

<main class="mgdb-page mgdb-gene-record-page" id="gene-record-top" data-gene-id="$(gene_api_id)" data-gene-state="$(gene_state)">
  <nav class="mgdb-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/sitemap">Data hubs</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/gene_center/gene">Gene Center</a><span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span><span aria-current="page">$(gene_name)</span>
  </nav>

  @(withdrawn_notice {display: off}
  <div class="mgdb-message mgdb-message-error" role="alert">
    <div>
      <strong>This gene model has been withdrawn.</strong>
      <span>$(withdrawn_message)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  )

  <header class="mgdb-hero-record">
    <div>
      <span class="mgdb-eyebrow">$(gene_eyebrow)</span>
      <h1>
        <span class="gene-record-title">$(gene_name)</span>
        $(status_badge)
      </h1>
      @(gene_full_name_block {display: off}<p class="gene-record-fullname">$(gene_full_name)</p>)
      @(gene_accession_block {display: off}<p class="gene-record-accession">Gene model <code id="gene-record-accession">$(gene_accession)</code> <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-quiet gene-record-copy" type="button" data-copy-target="gene-record-accession">Copy</button></p>)
      <p class="gene-record-function" id="gene-record-function" hidden></p>
      <p class="gene-record-synonyms" id="gene-record-synonyms" hidden></p>
      <dl class="mgdb-record-facts" id="gene-record-facts">$(gene_facts)</dl>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-hero-record-actions" id="gene-record-actions"></div>
  </header>

  <div class="gene-record-chips" id="gene-record-chips" hidden></div>

  <details class="gene-record-primer" id="gene-record-primer">
    <summary>What am I looking at?</summary>
    <div>
      <p>A <strong>gene model</strong> is a computational prediction of where a gene sits in a particular genome assembly and what protein it makes. Its name, such as <code>Zm00001eb067740</code>, is tied to one assembly and one annotation version, and it can change when the genome is re-annotated.</p>
      <p>A <strong>classical gene</strong> is a curated maize locus, usually named decades ago from a mutant phenotype &mdash; <code>lg1</code>, <em>liguleless1</em>. Its name does not change. When a gene model has been matched to a classical gene, this page shows both, and the curated literature, alleles and phenotypes below belong to the classical gene.</p>
      <p>A <strong>pan-gene</strong> groups the gene models that represent the same gene across many maize and wild <em>Zea</em> assemblies, which is how you tell whether a gene is present in one line or in all of them.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

  <nav class="mgdb-section-tabs" id="gene-record-tabs" aria-label="Sections on this record" hidden></nav>

  <div class="mgdb-loading" id="gene-record-loading"><span class="mgdb-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Loading the full record&hellip;</span></div>

  <div class="mgdb-message mgdb-message-error" id="gene-record-error" role="alert" hidden>
    <div>
      <strong>The rest of this record could not be loaded.</strong>
      <span>The identity above is correct. Reload to try again, or report it if it keeps happening.</span>
      <button class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary" id="gene-record-retry" type="button">Retry</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mgdb-message mgdb-message-info" id="gene-record-notice" role="status" hidden></div>

  <section id="gene-record-overview" aria-labelledby="gene-record-overview-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Record</span><h2 id="gene-record-overview-title">Overview</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-overview-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-structure" aria-labelledby="gene-record-structure-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Transcripts and protein</span><h2 id="gene-record-structure-title">Structure</h2></div>
      <p>The transcripts this gene model produces and the protein domains found in them.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-structure-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-function" aria-labelledby="gene-record-function-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">What it does</span><h2 id="gene-record-function-title">Function</h2></div>
      <p>Ontology terms, gene products and protein-family assignments, each with the evidence behind it.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-function-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-expression" aria-labelledby="gene-record-expression-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Where it is expressed</span><h2 id="gene-record-expression-title">Expression</h2></div>
      <p>Held by external services and loaded by your browser, not by MaizeGDB.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-expression-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-variation" aria-labelledby="gene-record-variation-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Mutants and association</span><h2 id="gene-record-variation-title">Variation</h2></div>
      <p>Insertion alleles you can order, trait associations from GWAS, and curated classical alleles.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-variation-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-pan_gene" aria-labelledby="gene-record-pan_gene-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Across the pan-genome</span><h2 id="gene-record-pan_gene-title">Pan-gene</h2></div>
      <p>The same gene in every assembly where it has been found, and its orthologs in other grasses.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-pan_gene-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-locus" aria-labelledby="gene-record-locus-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Curated by MaizeGDB</span><h2 id="gene-record-locus-title">Classical gene</h2></div>
      <p>What curators have recorded about this gene, independent of any one assembly.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-locus-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-references" aria-labelledby="gene-record-references-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Literature</span><h2 id="gene-record-references-title">References</h2></div>
      <p>Papers curated against this gene, newest first.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-references-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-sequences" aria-labelledby="gene-record-sequences-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Get the sequence</span><h2 id="gene-record-sequences-title">Sequences and downloads</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-sequences-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-xrefs" aria-labelledby="gene-record-xrefs-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Elsewhere</span><h2 id="gene-record-xrefs-title">Cross-references</h2></div>
      <p>This gene in other databases.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-xrefs-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="gene-record-provenance" aria-labelledby="gene-record-provenance-title" hidden>
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><span class="mgdb-eyebrow">How good is this model?</span><h2 id="gene-record-provenance-title">Model quality</h2></div>
      <p>Automated assessments of the gene model and its predicted protein. Each score is reported with what it means, not just its value.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="gene-record-provenance-body"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="mgdb-resource-panel" aria-labelledby="gene-record-next-title">
    <div>
      <span class="mgdb-eyebrow">Keep going</span>
      <h2 id="gene-record-next-title">From this gene</h2>
      <p>The searches and tools that take a single gene further.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-resource-list">
      <a href="/gene_center/gene"><strong>Search genes</strong><span>Find gene models and classical genes by name, function, or position.</span></a>
      <a href="/pan_gene_center/pan_gene"><strong>Pan-gene search</strong><span>Explore gene presence and absence across the maize pan-genome.</span></a>
      <a href="https\://jbrowse.maizegdb.org/"><strong>Genome browser</strong><span>See this region and its neighbours in JBrowse.</span></a>
      <a href="https\://wgs.maizegdb.org/"><strong>SNPversity 2.0</strong><span>Genotype data across the diversity panels.</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="gene-record-provenance-note">
    This page is assembled from one call to the MaizeGDB API.
    <a id="gene-record-api-link" href="/api/v1/records/gene/$(gene_api_id)">View this record as JSON</a>
    &middot; <a href="/api/v1/openapi">API documentation</a>
  </p>
</main>
)
